segmentation model, HoVer-style post-processing, cell-token extraction,
classifier head, training base classes, evaluation utilities); everything else
from upstream was removed. Three files outside third_party/ are also derived
from CellViT++ and carry the same header line:
    celluda/experiment.py, celluda/trainer.py, celluda/dataset.py

