3. HIPT / ViT-256-derived Vision Transformer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/cellvit/models/base/vision_transformer.py (used by the ViTCellViT
class in third_party/cellvit/models/cell_segmentation/backbones.py) is the
Vision Transformer implementation that CellViT++ uses for its HIPT/ViT-256
backbone. CellUDA does not run this encoder (the SAM-H encoder replaces it at
model construction), but the file is required to build the CellViT base class.
CellViT++ licenses its HIPT-derivative components under the Apache License 2.0
with the Commons Clause (Licensor: Mahmood Lab); see third_party/cellvit/LICENSE,
section 2.
